<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>VOIDRUN - 도트 생태 필드북 & 3D 파쿠르</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Three.js -->
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js"></script>
    <!-- Tone.js for Retro Chiptune & Procedural Sound Effects -->
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/tone/14.8.49/Tone.js"></script>
    <style>
        /* Retro Pixel Korean & English Fonts */
        @import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/projectnoonnu/noonfonts_2001@1.1/DungGeunMo.woff') format('woff');
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Press+Start+2P&display=swap');

        @font-face {
            font-family: 'DungGeunMo';
            src: url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/projectnoonnu/noonfonts_2001@1.1/DungGeunMo.woff') format('woff');
            font-weight: normal;
            font-style: normal;
        }

        * {
            user-select: none;
            -webkit-user-select: none;
            touch-action: none;
            image-rendering: pixelated;
            image-rendering: crisp-edges;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            background-color: #2d4c2b;
            font-family: 'DungGeunMo', 'Press Start 2P', monospace;
            color: #fff8e7;
        }

        .font-pixel-en {
            font-family: 'Press Start 2P', 'DungGeunMo', monospace;
        }

        /* ==========================================
           PIXEL ART & FIELDBOOK PARCHMENT UI STYLES
        ========================================== */
        .pixel-box {
            background-color: #4a3520;
            border: 4px solid #24170c;
            box-shadow:
                inset 3px 3px 0px #705234,
                inset -3px -3px 0px #2e1f11,
                4px 4px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
            border-radius: 0px !important;
        }

        .pixel-parchment {
            background-color: #f4e6c8;
            color: #2e1f11;
            border: 4px solid #3a2614;
            box-shadow:
                inset 4px 4px 0px #fff7e6,
                inset -4px -4px 0px #d4be94,
                6px 6px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);
            border-radius: 0px !important;
        }

        .pixel-parchment-dark {
            background-color: #e5d1a8;
            color: #2e1f11;
            border: 3px solid #593b1f;
            box-shadow:
                inset 2px 2px 0px #f7ebd2,
                inset -2px -2px 0px #bfa574;
        }

        .pixel-green-badge {
            background-color: #3f7a38;
            color: #f0fdf4;
            border: 2px solid #1b3b18;
            box-shadow: inset 2px 2px 0px #5ea355, inset -2px -2px 0px #275222;
        }

        .pixel-amber-badge {
            background-color: #d97706;
            color: #fffbeb;
            border: 2px solid #451a03;
            box-shadow: inset 2px 2px 0px #fbbf24, inset -2px -2px 0px #92400e;
        }

        .pixel-btn {
            background-color: #558b2f;
            color: #ffffff;
            border: 3px solid #1b330c;
            box-shadow:
                inset 3px 3px 0px #7cb342,
                inset -3px -3px 0px #33691e,
                3px 3px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            transition: transform 0.05s steps(2);
            border-radius: 0px !important;
        }

        .pixel-btn:hover {
            background-color: #689f38;
        }

        .pixel-btn:active {
            transform: translate(2px, 2px);
            box-shadow:
                inset 2px 2px 0px #33691e,
                1px 1px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        .pixel-btn-amber {
            background-color: #d97706;
            border: 3px solid #3b1802;
            box-shadow:
                inset 3px 3px 0px #f59e0b,
                inset -3px -3px 0px #92400e,
                3px 3px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        }

        .pixel-btn-amber:hover {
            background-color: #e68209;
        }

        /* Fieldbook Card */
        .fieldbook-card {
            background-color: #efe0c1;
            border: 3px solid #593b1f;
            box-shadow: inset 2px 2px 0px #fff8eb, inset -2px -2px 0px #cbb382, 3px 3px 0px rgba(46, 31, 17, 0.25);
            transition: transform 0.1s steps(2);
        }

        .fieldbook-card.unlocked:hover {
            transform: translate(-1px, -2px);
            border-color: #3f7a38;
            background-color: #f8eed9;
        }

        /* Touch Controls - Retro D-Pad & Gameboy Buttons */
        .btn-touch {
            background-color: #4a3520;
            border: 3px solid #1f140a;
            box-shadow:
                inset 3px 3px 0px #785736,
                inset -3px -3px 0px #2b1d10,
                3px 3px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
            color: #fef3c7;
            border-radius: 0px !important;
        }

        .btn-touch:active {
            transform: translate(2px, 2px);
            background-color: #d97706;
            box-shadow: inset 2px 2px 0px #78350f;
        }

        #joystick-zone {
            width: 124px;
            height: 124px;
            background-color: rgba(46, 31, 17, 0.65);
            border: 4px solid #24170c;
            box-shadow: inset 3px 3px 0px rgba(255, 240, 200, 0.15), 4px 4px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            touch-action: none;
            position: relative;
        }

        #joystick-knob {
            width: 46px;
            height: 46px;
            background-color: #d97706;
            border: 3px solid #24170c;
            box-shadow: inset 3px 3px 0px #fbbf24, inset -3px -3px 0px #92400e;
            position: absolute;
            transform: translate(0, 0);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* Pixel Crosshair */
        .crosshair {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            background: #fef08a;
            border: 2px solid #24170c;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        /* Subtle Retro Scanline & Pixel Border Frame */
        .retro-frame {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 6px #24170c, inset 0 0 40px rgba(20, 35, 15, 0.35);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 6;
        }

        /* Custom Scrollbar for Fieldbook */
        .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 10px;
        }
        .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #cbb382;
            border-left: 2px solid #593b1f;
        }
        .custom-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #6d4c2b;
            border: 2px solid #2e1f11;
        }

        @keyframes pixelBlink {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.06); }
        }
        .new-entry-badge {
            animation: pixelBlink 0.8s steps(2) infinite;
        }

        /* Canvas Crisp Pixelation */
        #game-container canvas {
            width: 100% !important;
            height: 100% !important;
            image-rendering: pixelated;
            image-rendering: crisp-edges;
        }
        .character-card { min-height: 112px; border-radius: 2px; transition: transform .12s ease, background .12s ease, border-color .12s ease; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:5px; padding:8px 5px; }
        .character-card:active { transform: translateY(1px) scale(.99); }
        .character-card:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #d97706; outline-offset: 2px; }
        .character-preview { width:58px; height:66px; display:block; image-rendering:pixelated; filter: drop-shadow(2px 3px 0 rgba(46,31,17,.22)); }
        .character-name { color:#3b2414; font-size:12px; line-height:1.2; font-weight:bold; }
        .character-card.selected-character { border-color:#9a5b18 !important; background:#fff1cf !important; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #e5b65f, 2px 2px 0 rgba(46,31,17,.18); }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="select-none overflow-hidden">

    <!-- 3D Pixel-Art Canvas Container -->
    <div id="game-container" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full"></div>
    <div class="retro-frame"></div>
    <div class="crosshair"></div>

    <!-- HUD Overlay -->
    <div id="hud" class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none flex flex-col justify-between p-3 md:p-4 z-20">
        <!-- Top Header -->
        <div class="flex justify-between items-start w-full gap-2">
            <!-- Left: Runner Status & Active Quest Tracker -->
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 max-w-[250px] md:max-w-[310px]">
                <!-- Explorer Status Card -->
                <div class="pixel-box p-2.5 md:p-3 flex flex-col gap-1.5 pointer-events-auto">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span class="text-[11px] px-1.5 py-0.5 pixel-green-badge font-bold" id="hud-stage-badge">FOREST 01</span>
                            <h1 class="text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-amber-300 tracking-wide">VOIDRUN</h1>
                        </div>
                        <span id="checkpoint-text" class="text-xs text-lime-300 font-bold">CP 0/7</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-xs text-amber-100 flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span id="player-nickname-display" class="font-bold text-yellow-200 truncate max-w-[130px]">YVES-SCOUT</span>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-amber-300"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt mr-1"></i>스태미나</span>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Pixel Stamina Bar -->
                    <div class="w-full bg-[#1f140a] h-3 p-0.5 border-2 border-[#120b05]">
                        <div id="stamina-bar" class="h-full bg-lime-500 w-full transition-all duration-75" style="box-shadow: inset 0 2px 0 #a3e635;"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Field Quest Tracker (Parchment Note Style) -->
                <div class="pixel-parchment p-2.5 md:p-3 pointer-events-auto">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1 border-b-2 border-[#bfa574] pb-1">
                        <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-[#3f7a38]">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-compass mr-1"></i>채집 탐사 퀘스트
                        </span>
                        <span id="quest-progress-badge" class="text-[10px] pixel-amber-badge px-1.5 py-0.5 font-bold">탐사중</span>
                    </div>
                    <p id="quest-title" class="text-xs md:text-sm font-bold text-[#24170c] leading-snug">가을 단풍 숲길 돌파하기</p>
                    <p id="quest-desc" class="text-[11px] text-[#593b1f] mt-0.5 leading-tight">흔들리는 나무 발판을 건너 체크포인트 1에 도달하세요.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right: Timer, Fieldbook Button & Quick Controls -->
            <div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-2 pointer-events-auto">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <!-- Fieldbook (Insect & Biomimicry Codex) Open Button -->
                    <button id="btn-open-fieldbook" class="pixel-parchment px-3 py-2 md:px-4 md:py-2.5 flex items-center gap-2 hover:bg-[#fff6e0] active:translate-y-0.5 transition-all relative">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open text-[#3f7a38] text-base md:text-lg"></i>
                        <div class="text-left">
                            <div class="text-[10px] text-[#6d4c2b] font-bold leading-none">FIELD BOOK</div>
                            <div class="text-xs md:text-sm font-bold text-[#24170c] mt-0.5">
                                도감 <span id="token-display" class="text-[#b45309]">0</span> / 10
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <span id="fieldbook-dot" class="hidden absolute -top-2 -right-2 px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-red-600 text-white text-[9px] border-2 border-[#24170c] font-bold">NEW!</span>
                    </button>

                    <!-- Pixel Resolution / Retro Filter Toggle -->
                    <button id="btn-pixel-toggle" title="도트 선명도 전환 (고/저해상도)" class="pixel-box w-10 h-10 md:w-11 md:h-11 flex items-center justify-center text-lime-300 hover:text-white active:translate-y-0.5">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-border-all text-base"></i>
                    </button>

                    <!-- Sound Toggle -->
                    <button id="btn-sound-toggle" title="칩튠 효과음 켜기/끄기" class="pixel-box w-10 h-10 md:w-11 md:h-11 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-300 hover:text-white active:translate-y-0.5">
                        <i id="sound-icon" class="fa-solid fa-volume-high text-base"></i>
                    </button>

                    <!-- Quick Restart Button -->
                    <button id="btn-quick-restart" title="탐사 처음부터 재시작 (R)" class="pixel-box w-10 h-10 md:w-11 md:h-11 flex items-center justify-center text-orange-300 hover:text-white active:translate-y-0.5">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-right text-base"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Timer & Speedometer -->
                <div class="pixel-box px-3 py-2 md:px-4 md:py-2.5 flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="text-right">
                        <div class="text-[10px] text-amber-300/80">SPEED</div>
                        <div class="text-xs md:text-sm font-bold text-lime-300"><span id="speed-display">0</span> <span class="text-[10px]">km/h</span></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="h-6 w-[2px] bg-[#24170c]"></div>
                    <div class="text-right">
                        <div class="text-[10px] text-amber-300/80">TIME</div>
                        <div id="timer-display" class="text-base md:text-xl font-bold text-yellow-300 leading-none">00:00.00</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Center Notification Toast -->
        <div id="toast-message" class="self-center pixel-parchment px-4 py-2 text-xs md:text-sm font-bold transform translate-y-16 opacity-0 transition-all duration-200 pointer-events-none text-center flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-leaf text-[#3f7a38]"></i>
            <span id="toast-text">채집 준비 완료</span>
        </div>

        <!-- In-stage practical tutorial card -->
        <div id="tutorial-card" class="hidden absolute z-[60] pointer-events-auto top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[min(92%,420px)] pixel-parchment p-4 text-left shadow-xl">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-2">
                <h3 id="tutorial-card-title" class="font-bold text-sm text-[#3f7a38]">실전 튜토리얼</h3>
                <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-[#7c2d12]">AREA 01</span>
            </div>
            <p id="tutorial-card-body" class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#24170c]">주변 함정을 통과하는 방법을 익혀보세요.</p>
            <button id="tutorial-card-close" type="button" class="relative z-[61] pointer-events-auto cursor-pointer mt-3 px-4 py-2 bg-[#3f7a38] text-white text-xs font-bold border-2 border-[#24170c]">확인하고 도전하기</button>
        </div>

        <!-- Bottom Touch Controls -->
        <div id="touch-controls" class="w-full flex justify-between items-end pointer-events-none pb-1 px-1">
            <!-- Left: Virtual Joystick -->
            <div class="pointer-events-auto" id="joystick-zone">
                <div id="joystick-knob"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Desktop Controls Hint -->
            <div class="hidden lg:flex items-center gap-2 pixel-box px-4 py-1.5 text-xs text-amber-100">
                <span><b class="text-yellow-300">WASD</b> 이동</span> •
                <span><b class="text-yellow-300">Space</b> 점프/벽타기</span> •
                <span><b class="text-yellow-300">Shift</b> 질주</span> •
                <span><b class="text-yellow-300">E</b> 대시</span> •
                <span><b class="text-yellow-300">C</b> 슬라이드/급강하</span> •
                <span><b class="text-yellow-300">B</b> 필드북</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Right: Action Buttons -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 pointer-events-auto md:gap-2.5 items-center">
                <button id="btn-dash" class="btn-touch w-12 h-12 md:w-14 md:h-14 flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-bold text-[11px]">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-sm mb-0.5 text-yellow-300"></i>
                    대시
                </button>
                <button id="btn-sprint" class="btn-touch w-12 h-12 md:w-14 md:h-14 flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-bold text-[11px]">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-person-running text-sm mb-0.5 text-lime-300"></i>
                    질주
                </button>
                <button id="btn-jump" class="btn-touch w-16 h-16 md:w-20 md:h-20 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-sm !bg-[#3f7a38] row-span-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-angles-up text-lg mb-0.5 text-yellow-200"></i>
                    점프
                </button>

                <button id="btn-slide" class="btn-touch w-12 h-12 md:w-14 md:h-14 flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-bold text-[11px]">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-person-sliding text-sm mb-0.5 text-amber-300"></i>
                    슬라이드
                </button>
                <button id="btn-dive" class="btn-touch w-12 h-12 md:w-14 md:h-14 flex flex-col items-center justify-center font-bold text-[11px]">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down text-sm mb-0.5 text-red-400"></i>
                    급강하
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Developer Mode Floating Button -->
    <button id="btn-dev-mode" class="fixed bottom-3 right-3 z-30 px-2.5 py-1 pixel-box text-amber-200 hover:text-white font-bold text-[10px] flex items-center gap-1 opacity-75 hover:opacity-100">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-terminal"></i> DEV
    </button>

    <!-- ==========================================
         FIELDBOOK (PIXEL ART INSECT & BIOMIMICRY CODEX) MODAL
    ========================================== -->
    <div id="fieldbook-modal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/75 flex items-center justify-center p-4 z-50">
        <div class="pixel-parchment max-w-2xl w-full overflow-hidden flex flex-col max-h-[86vh]">
            <!-- Fieldbook Header -->
            <div class="p-4 bg-[#4a3520] text-[#fff8e7] border-b-4 border-[#24170c] flex justify-between items-center">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="w-11 h-11 pixel-green-badge flex items-center justify-center text-xl">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bug"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-yellow-300 tracking-wide">곤충 생태 & 생체모방 필드북</h2>
                        <p class="text-xs text-amber-100/90">숲과 협곡에서 채집한 곤충 표본과 자연 모사 공학 기록입니다.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button id="btn-close-fieldbook" class="pixel-btn-amber w-9 h-9 text-white flex items-center justify-center">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-lg"></i>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Progress Summary Bar -->
            <div class="px-4 py-2.5 bg-[#e5d1a8] border-b-2 border-[#bfa574] flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold">
                <span class="text-[#4a3520]"><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass mr-1"></i>표본 채집 달성도</span>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="w-32 md:w-48 bg-[#4a3520] h-3 p-0.5 border-2 border-[#24170c]">
                        <div id="fieldbook-progress-bar" class="h-full bg-[#3f7a38] transition-all duration-300" style="width: 0%"></div>
                    </div>
                    <span id="fieldbook-count-text" class="text-[#24170c]">0 / 10 종</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Fieldbook Grid Content -->
            <div id="fieldbook-grid" class="p-4 overflow-y-auto custom-scroll grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 bg-[#f4e6c8]">
                <!-- Cards injected dynamically via JS with Pixel Sprite Icons -->
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ==========================================
         START / GAME OVER / CLEAR MODAL
    ========================================== -->
    <div id="menu-modal" class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/70 flex items-center justify-center p-4 z-40 overflow-y-auto">
        <div class="pixel-parchment max-w-md w-full p-5 md:p-7 text-center relative">
            <!-- Start Setup View -->
            <div id="modal-content-start">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 pixel-green-badge font-bold text-xs mb-3">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-seedling"></i> PIXEL INSECT & BIOMIMICRY QUEST
                </div>
                <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#24170c] tracking-wider mb-1" style="text-shadow: 2px 2px 0px #d4be94;">
                    VOIDRUN
                </h1>
                <p class="text-xs text-[#593b1f] mb-4">공중 섬과 도트 숲을 달리며 10종의 곤충·생체모방 표본을 필드북에 채집하세요!</p>

                <p class="text-[11px] text-[#593b1f] mb-3">첫 번째 구역은 실전 튜토리얼입니다. 진행 중 나타나는 설명창을 따라 함정을 통과하세요.</p>

                <!-- Character Select -->
                <div class="pixel-parchment-dark p-3 my-3 text-left">
                    <div class="mb-2">
                        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-[#3f7a38]"><i class="fa-solid fa-users mr-1"></i> 주인공 선택</h3>
                    </div>
                    <div id="character-selector" class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                        <button type="button" data-character="jumper" aria-label="루키 점퍼 선택" aria-pressed="true" class="character-card selected-character border-2 border-[#9a5b18] bg-[#fff1cf]">
